WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.887
A private knowledge base may contain local documents, notes, PDFs, markdown, policies,

00:00:04.887 --> 00:00:07.679
internal guides, code, or other approved sources.

00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:11.668
Ingestion should preserve ownership, classification, version, date, and access rules.

00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:13.264
Retrieval-augmented generation, or RAG,

00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:17.652
selects relevant source passages and places them in the model's context.

00:00:17.652 --> 00:00:23.237
It does not retrain the model or guarantee that the answer follows the sources.

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:25.630
Embeddings represent text for similarity search.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:29.619
Chunk size, overlap, metadata, document structure, embedding model, query wording,

00:00:29.619 --> 00:00:32.412
and retrieval count affect what is found.

00:00:32.412 --> 00:00:36.002
A vector database is not an authority by itself.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:40.789
Grounded answers should cite source context close enough for users to verify.

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:45.177
Preserve document title, section, page or anchor, version, and access path.

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:48.767
The interface should distinguish retrieved text from model interpretation.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.559
Respect source permissions during indexing and retrieval.

00:00:51.559 --> 00:00:57.543
A user should not receive a passage merely because it exists in the shared index.

00:00:57.543 --> 00:01:01.931
Apply document-level or chunk-level authorization where the use case requires it.

00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:03.925
Evaluate retrieval separately from generation.

00:01:03.925 --> 00:01:08.712
Ask whether the correct passage was found, whether irrelevant text entered context,

00:01:08.712 --> 00:01:11.904
and whether the answer accurately reflected the source.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:15.095
Review stale documents, duplicates, conflicting versions, and deletion.

00:01:15.095 --> 00:01:17.089
Retrieved content is untrusted input.

00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:22.674
Documents may contain instructions that conflict with system policy or attempt to redirect tools.

00:01:22.674 --> 00:01:27.860
Separate source text from control instructions and constrain any actions that follow retrieval.
